ms/v1/","context":{"app_id":4932820,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4932820-1843481262701034","game_id":"steam-4932820","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update - v0.4.1","summary":"A new demo update is here.AddedAdded 6 new languages: Turkish, Spanish (Latin America), Spanish (Spain), Italian, Polish, and Dutch.Added Steam Cloud Save.Added Samurai Execution tutorial for the first attempt.ChangedAdjusted Skill Tree upgrade prices.FixedFixed the Helper Hand reappearing under certain conditions after enabling Hide Helper Hand.Thanks for playing Bottle Flip Inc and for all the feedback.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T08:27:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262701034","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:09:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4932820-1843481262688587","game_id":"steam-4932820","kind":"announcement","title":"Thanks for 5,000 Wishlists!","summary":"We've reached 5,000 wishlists for Bottle Flip Inc!Thank you so much to everyone who played the demo, wishlisted the game, shared it, and supported us. We're a small indie team of two, and every bit of support means a lot to us!Let's keep flipping!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T10:10:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262688587","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:09:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4932820-1842212951310015","game_id":"steam-4932820","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update - v0.4.0","summary":"Hey everyone! :))First of all, thank you so much for all the feedback you've been giving us. We're reading through your comments and suggestions, and they really help us understand what feels good and what we can improve.It's also been one month since we launched our Steam page, and we've reached 4,300 wishlists! That's honestly way more than we expected, and we're incredibly grateful to everyone who has wishlisted the game, played the demo, shared it with others, and given us feedback. It reall","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T12:11:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951310015","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:09:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4932820-1840944183779023","game_id":"steam-4932820","kind":"announcement","title":"Thanks for 1,000 Wishlists!","summary":"Thanks so much for playing and wishlisting our game :)We're super happy about your feedback and suggestions, and it's amazing to see so many of you enjoying the demo.We're working on new systems and stuff for the full game and giving our best to make it as fun as possible.Demo Update - v0.2.3FixesFixed an issue where bottles could disappear or occasionally land outside the table.Fixed incorrect information displayed for the Helper Hand upgrade.Fixed some bugs.NewAdded more options for Display Mo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-14T09:11:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183779023","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:09:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4932820-1840944183772795","game_id":"steam-4932820","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update - v0.2.1","summary":"Demo Update - v0.2.1We have pushed a couple of fixes and improvements:Fixed bottles becoming invisible after using certain skills.Added responsive UI support for different screen resolutions.Thank you for playing and reporting issues. Your feedback really helps us improve the game.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-12T01:56:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183772795","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:09:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4932820-1840310314347410","game_id":"steam-4932820","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Out Now!","summary":"Hey everyone :)We’ve just released the Bottle Flip Inc Demo!The demo offers around 30 minutes of content, with up to 1 hour depending on how you play.We are happy to hear your feedback and are open for feature requests for the demo and especially the full game.Drop your thoughts in the Steam Discussions or join our Discord and come say hi!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-08T13:01:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314347410","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:09:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4932820":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:30:59Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:30:59Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4932820":"2026-10-26T05:30:59Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4932820":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:30:59Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:30:59Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4966120":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:30:59Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:30:59Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4932820","app_id":4932820,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:09Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"statu